i=A.uB(265,"BLB Librarian (Better Letter Book) is a next-generation Flutter IoT & EdTech mobile ecosystem bridging physical books with interactive digital media. Through real-time NFC/RFID tag scanning, physical books instantly trigger synchronized digital experiences including video, audio, stories, and games. Features a dedicated parent management system for 'Little Ones' with a secured Kiosk Safety Mode ensuring kids only access parent-curated content without leaving the sandbox. Includes cloud storage quotas, device pairing limits, and flexible subscription tiers.",h,"blb_librarian","BLB Librarian","",A.b(["Architected the app using Clean Architecture and responsive UI adapted for phones and tablets.","Integrated native NFC & RFID scanning protocols for instantaneous physical book detection.","Engineered the Kiosk Safety Mode sandbox to enforce parent-curated content boundaries.","Built dynamic multi-profile state management allowing parents to toggle and monitor child spaces.","Implemented cloud media streaming, storage quota tracking, and subscription billing state."],j),g,"Smart IoT & EdTech mobile library with NFC/RFID book scanning, parent-controlled Kiosk Safety mode, and multimedia learning.",i)
